Spider-Man: No Way Home is a action, adventure,
science fiction film directed by Jon Watts.

3
00:13:52,500 --> 00:13:58,500
Peter Parker is unmasked and no longer able to separate his normal
life from the high-stakes of being a super-hero.

4
